Package: mesa-libclc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenCL C library for Mesa, in SPIR-V
 The libclc build that Mesa uses for OpenCL (rusticl). It is a fork of
 LLVM libclc, pinned to a known good state, with fixes for Mesa.
 .
 This package holds the SPIR-V files and the mesa-libclc.pc file for the
 Mesa build.
